  "body": "Currently, it takes forever to run our test suite, which is a bit annoying. Some changes we might want to consider making:\r\n\r\n1. Move the builds that take ages to not start last. We probably do want to run pep8/isort first, but equally `packaging` probably doesn't need to run till the end\r\n2. Do we need all the builds? For example do we need to have both `py27` and `py27` old? ",
